WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:07.675
Let's count! Point to each one as you say its number. Only count each one one time.

00:08.125 --> 00:11.956
One, two, three, four, five. There are five.

00:12.406 --> 00:17.004
The last number you say tells how many. There are five.

00:17.454 --> 00:23.027
Now let's count more. Keep going to ten. Six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:23.477 --> 00:27.935
Ten! Great counting. You can count to ten.

00:28.385 --> 00:35.699
Now you try. Touch each one, and count out loud. Take your time, and say each number once.
